OL,3,GNEWSA'Summer drought made our pumpkins
OL,4,Asmaller'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs Halloween approaches, families are
OL,7,Ftaking advantage of the October half
OL,8,Fterm to stock up on pumpkins for the
OL,9,Fspooky season.
OL,11,FBut at one Worcestershire farm, despite
OL,12,Fa "really great season" and its largest
OL,13,Fever patch spanning 4.5 acres (1.8
OL,14,Fhectares), the pumpkins themselves were
OL,15,Fsmaller than usual
OL,17,FGillian Kerton, who runs Churchfields
OL,18,FFarm Park near Droitwich, said the
OL,19,Fweather had initially been good until
OL,20,Fthe dry and hot summer.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
