OL,3,GNEWSA'Summer drought made our pumpkins
OL,4,Asmaller'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The actual pumpkins themselves, they
OL,7,Fgrew really well early on because we
OL,8,Fhad that very wet spring," she told BBC
OL,9,FMidlands Today.
